<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Order Cancelled</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #f44336;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }

        .content {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: #3f51b5;
            color: white !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h2>Order Cancelled by Seller</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hi {{buyerName}},</p>

        <p>We regret to inform you that your order <strong>#{{orderId}}</strong> was cancelled by the seller
            ({{sellerName}}).</p>

        <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{cancellationReason}}</p>

        <p><strong>Notes:</strong></p>
        <blockquote>{{cancellationNotes}}</blockquote>

        <p><strong>Cancelled On:</strong> {{cancellationDate}}</p>

        <a class="button" href="{{dashboardLink}}">View Order in Dashboard</a>

        <p>If you have any concerns, feel free to contact us.</p>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. Contact <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>
                for help.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>